{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Limitguard.ai","version":"0.1.0","description":"Limitguard is a lead validation service for lead generation agencies, B2B marketing and sales teams: it checks the company behind each lead against official business registers (full coverage in the Netherlands and Belgium), EU VAT and sanctions lists, with website age in the company check, and returns proceed, review or block with the source on every line. Developers and AI agents can use its HTTP API, MCP server and A2A service, hosted in the EU. Free sandbox key, no wallet. The sandbox covers entity, risk and KYB checks; Lead Verify and the agent check need a live key or an x402 payment. Lead Verify $0.27 per lead and agent check $0.75 per wallet; $0.11-1.85 per call; entity and risk checks $0.88-1.05 fresh ($1.50 KYB), $0.11 cached ($0.25 KYB) when available. Lead verification for NL and BE leads, plus entity, KYB and agent wallet checks, paid per call with x402 (USDC on Base or Solana).","contact":{"name":"Limitguard support","email":"support@limitguard.ai","url":"https://limitguard.ai/?utm_source=api&utm_medium=agent&utm_campaign=home&utm_content=website"},"x-logo":{"url":"https://limitguard.ai/assets/brand/logo.svg","altText":"Limitguard","backgroundColor":"#F3EEE2","href":"https://limitguard.ai/?utm_source=api&utm_medium=agent&utm_campaign=home&utm_content=website"},"x-guidance":"Free sandbox key, no wallet: POST https://api.limitguard.ai/v1/keys/create with {\"email\": \"you@example.com\", \"tier\": \"sandbox\"} returns an lg_sandbox_ key; send it as X-API-Key for mock data at no charge. The sandbox covers entity, risk and KYB checks; Lead Verify and the agent check need a live key or an x402 payment.\nPaying per call: call a priced operation with no credentials. It answers 402 with an x402 v2 challenge in the base64 PAYMENT-REQUIRED header and the JSON body. Pay in USDC on Base or Solana and retry with the PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header.\nPrepaid: an lg_live_ key sent as X-API-Key is debited per call at the same prices instead. Buy balance with POST /v1/keys/upgrade/{tier}.\nOperations with a dynamic price accept X-Response-Quality: cached, fresh or enhanced; fresh is the default, and an endpoint without a cached tier charges fresh.\nFull guide: https://api.limitguard.ai/llms.txt"},"servers":[{"url":"https://api.limitguard.ai"}],"externalDocs":{"url":"https://docs.limitguard.ai/x402-protocol?utm_source=api&utm_medium=agent&utm_campaign=docs&utm_content=x402_protocol"},"x-agentcash-guidance":{"llmsTxtUrl":"https://api.limitguard.ai/llms.txt"},"paths":{"/v1/entity/check":{"post":{"summary":"Verify an entity across registries, sanctions and risk layers","description":"Full entity trust check across multiple verification layers: KVK/CBE registry, OpenSanctions, country risk (CPI/FATF), domain WHOIS, IBAN validation and EU VAT/VIES. Returns trust score 0-100 with cluster and recommendation.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"entity_name":{"type":"string","description":"Legal entity name"},"country":{"type":"string","description":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code"},"kvk_number":{"type":"string","description":"Dutch KVK number (8 digits)"},"cbe_number":{"type":"string","description":"Belgian CBE number (0XXX.XXX.XXX or 10 digits)"},"domain":{"type":"string","description":"Entity website domain"},"iban":{"type":"string","description":"IBAN for financial validation"},"vat_number":{"type":"string","description":"EU VAT number"},"wallet_address":{"type":"string","description":"Crypto wallet address (format check only; no on-chain lookup)"},"wallet_chain":{"type":"string","description":"Blockchain the address is checked against (eth, base, polygon, arbitrum, btc, sol). Defaults to eth when omitted, so send btc or sol with a Bitcoin or Solana address"},"target_industries":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":100},"maxItems":20,"description":"Ideal-customer industries: SBI/NACE code prefixes (\"62\", \"64.20\") or plain words matched as whole words against the register's activity descriptions. Information only: never changes the score."},"target_size":{"type":"object","properties":{"min":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"max":{"type":"integer","minimum":0}},"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Ideal-customer employee range, both ends inclusive. Information only."}},"required":["entity_name","country"]}}}},"security":[{"ApiKey":[]},{}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"dynamic","currency":"USD","min":"0.11","max":"1.05"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success","content":{"application/json":{"example":{"trust_score":87,"cluster":"verified","recommendation":"APPROVE","sources_checked":7,"entity_name":"Acme Corp BV","country":"NL","risk_factors":[]}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The x402 v2 challenge is in the base64 PAYMENT-REQUIRED header and the JSON body; pay and retry with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE, or send X-API-Key with prepaid balance.","headers":{"PAYMENT-REQUIRED":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"x402Version":{"type":"integer"},"accepts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"error":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}}},"/v1/risk/score":{"post":{"summary":"Score an entity's risk (0-100) from name and country","description":"Quick risk score (0-100) for entity name + country. Lightweight check without full data source scan.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"entity_name":{"type":"string","description":"Legal entity name"},"country":{"type":"string","description":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code"}},"required":["entity_name","country"]}}}},"security":[{"ApiKey":[]},{}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"dynamic","currency":"USD","min":"0.11","max":"0.90"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success","content":{"application/json":{"example":{"risk_score":23,"risk_level":"low","entity_name":"Acme Corp BV","country":"NL"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The x402 v2 challenge is in the base64 PAYMENT-REQUIRED header and the JSON body; pay and retry with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE, or send X-API-Key with prepaid balance.","headers":{"PAYMENT-REQUIRED":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"x402Version":{"type":"integer"},"accepts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"error":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}}},"/v1/reputation/score":{"post":{"summary":"Score an entity's reputation with linear trust decay","description":"Reputation scoring with linear trust decay: after its first week a score loses 2-5 points a week by risk cluster (none for a sanctions-flagged entity), plus a bonus of up to 5 points for repeat verifications.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"entity_name":{"type":"string","description":"Legal entity name"},"country":{"type":"string","description":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code. Required unless trust_score and cluster are both sent; the score is then computed from sanctions and jurisdiction"},"trust_score":{"type":"integer","description":"Latest trust score (0-100). Send with cluster to skip auto-computation"},"cluster":{"type":"string","description":"Current cluster assignment. Send with trust_score to skip auto-computation"},"last_verified_at":{"type":"number","description":"Unix timestamp of last verification (defaults to now)"},"verification_count":{"type":"integer","description":"Times entity verified"},"agent_id":{"type":"string","description":"ERC-8004 agent ID for verification"}},"required":["entity_name"]}}}},"security":[{"ApiKey":[]},{}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"dynamic","currency":"USD","min":"0.11","max":"0.90"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success","content":{"application/json":{"example":{"reputation_score":92,"trend":"stable","confidence":0.87,"verification_count":12}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The x402 v2 challenge is in the base64 PAYMENT-REQUIRED header and the JSON body; pay and retry with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE, or send X-API-Key with prepaid balance.","headers":{"PAYMENT-REQUIRED":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"x402Version":{"type":"integer"},"accepts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"error":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}}},"/v1/wallet/balance":{"get":{"summary":"Get an ERC-8004 agent's USDC balance on Base","description":"ERC-8004 agent wallet balance check. Returns the on-chain USDC balance (Base mainnet) for a registered ERC-8004 agent wallet.","parameters":[{"name":"agent_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Agent wallet address (EVM 0x + 40 hex chars, Base mainnet); must be registered in the ERC-8004 Identity Registry"}],"security":[{"ApiKey":[]},{}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.11"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success","content":{"application/json":{"example":{"agent_id":"0x1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef12345678","chain":"base","currency":"USDC","balance_usdc":150.5,"balance_raw":150500000,"last_updated":1757894400.0}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The x402 v2 challenge is in the base64 PAYMENT-REQUIRED header and the JSON body; pay and retry with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE, or send X-API-Key with prepaid balance.","headers":{"PAYMENT-REQUIRED":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"x402Version":{"type":"integer"},"accepts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"error":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}}},"/v1/compliance/alerts":{"get":{"summary":"Get sanctions-list changes and hits on entities you checked","description":"Daily changes to the OFAC, EU and UN sanctions lists, plus alerts when an entity or wallet this key checked is listed. Poll this route; alerts about entities or wallets this key checked are also sent to a webhook registered for sanctions.match.new (POST /v1/webhooks). Filter by jurisdiction and severity.","parameters":[{"name":"jurisdiction","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Filter by jurisdiction of the source list: us, eu or un"},{"name":"severity","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"Filter by severity (informational, low, medium, high, critical)"},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer"},"description":"Results per page (1-200, default 50)"},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer"},"description":"Pagination offset"}],"security":[{"ApiKey":[]},{}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.11"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success","content":{"application/json":{"example":{"total":0,"offset":0,"limit":50,"alerts":[]}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The x402 v2 challenge is in the base64 PAYMENT-REQUIRED header and the JSON body; pay and retry with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE, or send X-API-Key with prepaid balance.","headers":{"PAYMENT-REQUIRED":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"x402Version":{"type":"integer"},"accepts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"error":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}}},"/v1/sanctions/screen":{"post":{"summary":"Screen a name against the OFAC, EU and UN sanctions lists","description":"Sanctions screen of a company or person name against the OFAC SDN, EU and UN sanctions lists, held locally and refreshed daily. Returns each matched entry: list, entry id, matched name, programmes, countries, listing date and match score. Exact normalised or word-order-insensitive name match only; a name match is not a determination.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","description":"Company or person name to screen"},"country":{"type":"string","description":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code (optional; orders matches, never excludes one)"}},"required":["name"]}}}},"security":[{"ApiKey":[]},{}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.11"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success","content":{"application/json":{"example":{"possible_match":true,"matches":[{"list":"OFAC SDN","list_key":"ofac_sdn","entry_id":"12345","entry_type":"entity","matched_name":"EXAMPLE TRADING LLC","programmes":["SDGT"],"countries":["AE"],"listed_on":"2024-05-01","match_score":1.0,"match_type":"name_exact"}],"matches_truncated":false,"lists_checked":["OFAC SDN","EU","UN"],"list_dates":{"OFAC SDN":"2026-09-30","EU":"2026-09-30","UN":"2026-09-29"},"disclaimer":"A name match is not a determination: confirm identity with the listed identifiers before acting.","screened_at":"2026-10-01T10:00:00+00:00"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The x402 v2 challenge is in the base64 PAYMENT-REQUIRED header and the JSON body; pay and retry with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE, or send X-API-Key with prepaid balance.","headers":{"PAYMENT-REQUIRED":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"x402Version":{"type":"integer"},"accepts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"error":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}}},"/v1/kyb/check":{"post":{"summary":"Run a KYB check: registry, sanctions, VAT/VIES and domain","description":"Know Your Business verification: company registration, sanctions screening, VAT/VIES, and domain analysis in one call.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"entity_id":{"type":"string","description":"Internal entity identifier"},"registration_number":{"type":"string","description":"Company registration number"},"country":{"type":"string","description":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code"},"entity_name":{"type":"string","description":"Legal entity name (optional)"},"vat_number":{"type":"string","description":"VAT number for VIES verification"},"domain":{"type":"string","description":"Company domain for web presence check"}},"required":["entity_id","registration_number","country"]}}}},"security":[{"ApiKey":[]},{}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"dynamic","currency":"USD","min":"0.25","max":"1.50"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success","content":{"application/json":{"example":{"verified":true,"register_verified":true,"register_checked":"KVK","sanctions_flagged":false,"kyb_status":"approved","trust_score":91}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The x402 v2 challenge is in the base64 PAYMENT-REQUIRED header and the JSON body; pay and retry with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE, or send X-API-Key with prepaid balance.","headers":{"PAYMENT-REQUIRED":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"x402Version":{"type":"integer"},"accepts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"error":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}}},"/v1/entity/deep-check":{"post":{"summary":"Check an entity for PEP ties, insolvency and adverse media","description":"Extended screening in two tiers. fresh ($0.88): politically exposed person and relative/close-associate (role.pep / role.rca) matches from OpenSanctions, with the match detail the standard entity check does not return, plus a Dutch Centraal Insolventieregister screen (NL only). enhanced ($1.71): the same plus adverse media screening against a global news index. If a source of the requested tier cannot be reached the call returns 503 and is not charged.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"entity_name":{"type":"string","description":"Legal entity or person name"},"country":{"type":"string","description":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code"},"kvk_number":{"type":"string","description":"Dutch KVK number (8 digits), optional; exact insolvency-register lookup"},"credit_report_identifier":{"type":"string","description":"VAT number, tax code or company ID, optional; enables the `credit` tier's Italian credit report (Italy only, available when enabled)"}},"required":["entity_name","country"]}}}},"security":[{"ApiKey":[]},{}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"dynamic","currency":"USD","min":"0.88","max":"1.71"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success","content":{"application/json":{"example":{"entity_name":"Jan de Vries","country":"NL","quality":"deep","sources_returned":["pep_extended","insolvency_records"],"pep_extended":{"screened":true,"pep_exposure":true,"match_count":1,"matches":[{"caption":"Jan de Vries","schema_type":"Person","topics":["role.pep"],"datasets":["everypolitician"],"score":0.88,"countries":["nl"],"birth_date":"1965-04-12"}],"truncated":false,"retrieved_at":"2026-01-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"insolvency_records":{"screened":true,"applicable":true,"jurisdiction":"NL","query_by":"name","found":false,"match_count":0,"records":[],"truncated":false,"retrieved_at":"2026-01-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"processing_time_ms":420}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The x402 v2 challenge is in the base64 PAYMENT-REQUIRED header and the JSON body; pay and retry with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE, or send X-API-Key with prepaid balance.","headers":{"PAYMENT-REQUIRED":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"x402Version":{"type":"integer"},"accepts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"error":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}}},"/v1/reports/entity":{"post":{"summary":"Build a compliance report on an entity","description":"Per-entity report built from one real check's signals: identity, sanctions and PEP screening, domain signals, trust score (risk.trust_score, 0-100, 100 = best), correlations with the caller's earlier reports, sources and an evidence hash. A source that did not answer is shown unavailable, never clean.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"check_id":{"type":"string","description":"Id of a check stored by an earlier /v1/reports/entity call"},"entity_name":{"type":"string","description":"Legal entity name"},"country":{"type":"string","description":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code"},"kvk_number":{"type":"string","description":"Dutch KVK number (8 digits)"},"cbe_number":{"type":"string","description":"Belgian CBE number (0XXX.XXX.XXX or 10 digits)"},"vat_number":{"type":"string","description":"EU VAT number"},"domain":{"type":"string","description":"Entity website domain"},"iban":{"type":"string","description":"IBAN for financial validation"},"wallet_address":{"type":"string","description":"Crypto wallet address (format check only; no on-chain lookup)"},"wallet_chain":{"type":"string","description":"Blockchain the address is checked against"}},"required":[]}}}},"security":[{"ApiKey":[]},{}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"1.85"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success","content":{"application/json":{"example":{"report_id":"3f9c1e2a-1111-4a2b-9c3d-000000000001","check_id":"3f9c1e2a-1111-4a2b-9c3d-000000000000","entity":{"entity_name":"Acme Corp BV","country":"NL"},"sanctions":{"status":"ok","result":"no_match","threshold":0.7,"lists":[]},"pep":{"status":"ok","exposure":false,"matches":[]},"domain":{"status":"ok","domain":"acme.example","domain_age_days":3200},"risk":{"trust_score":87,"trust_level":"high","recommendation":"APPROVE","cluster":"verified","confidence":0.9,"sources_checked":5},"correlations":{"status":"ok","scope_note":"workspace_reports","links":[]},"sources":[{"source":"opensanctions","status":"ok"}],"evidence":{"report_hash":"sha256:...","hash_algorithm":"sha256"},"created_at":"2026-09-24T10:00:00Z"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The x402 v2 challenge is in the base64 PAYMENT-REQUIRED header and the JSON body; pay and retry with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE, or send X-API-Key with prepaid balance.","headers":{"PAYMENT-REQUIRED":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"x402Version":{"type":"integer"},"accepts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"error":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}}},"/v1/agent/check":{"post":{"summary":"Check an agent wallet: sanctions, balance, ERC-8004 identity","description":"Agent wallet check in one call: screens an EVM wallet against the OFAC SDN digital-currency address list, reads its Base USDC and ETH balance, looks up its ERC-8004 identity registration (and, given an agent id, that agent's owner and payment wallet) and lists open ERC-8004 feedback, which is not scored. Returns one verdict and each part's status; a part that could not be read says so.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"wallet":{"type":"string","description":"EVM wallet address (0x + 40 hex characters), read on Base"},"agent_id":{"type":"string","description":"Optional ERC-8004 agentId (decimal) the wallet claims"},"domain":{"type":"string","description":"Optional website domain the agent gives for itself; reported, never read by the verdict"}},"required":["wallet"]}}}},"security":[{"ApiKey":[]},{}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.75"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success","content":{"application/json":{"example":{"wallet":"0x7e4c2a91d05b3f68a1c9e2d4b7f05a3c6e81d290","chain_id":"eip155:8453","verdict":"no_findings","verdict_reasons":[],"ran":["sanctions","balance","identity","reputation","wallet_risk"],"did_not_run":[],"sanctions":{"status":"ok","reason":null,"hit":false,"lists":[],"programs":[],"list_as_of":"09/30/2026","list_status":"ok"},"balance":{"status":"ok","reason":null,"chain_id":"eip155:8453","balance_usdc":412.5,"balance_native":0.0031},"identity":{"status":"ok","reason":null,"registry":"erc8004","wallet_agent_ids":["1187"],"agent_id":"1187","agent_registered":true,"agent_owner":"0x7e4c2a91d05b3f68a1c9e2d4b7f05a3c6e81d290","agent_wallet":"0x7e4c2a91d05b3f68a1c9e2d4b7f05a3c6e81d290","wallet_controls_agent":true},"reputation":{"status":"ok","reason":null,"note":"open on-chain feedback, not used in the score","agents":[{"agent_id":"1187","feedback_count":3,"distinct_clients":2,"clients_capped":false,"top_tags":[{"tag":"starred","count":3,"avg":4.67}]}]},"wallet_risk":{"status":"ok","reason":null,"risk_score":10,"risk_level":"low","rules_fired":[]},"domain":{"status":"not_requested","reason":null,"domain":null,"probes":null,"domain_age_days":null,"domain_expires_at":null,"has_mx":null,"has_spf":null,"has_dmarc":null,"ssl_valid":null,"ssl_issuer":null,"web_score":null},"schema_version":"agent-check-v1","checked_at":"2026-10-01T10:00:00Z"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The x402 v2 challenge is in the base64 PAYMENT-REQUIRED header and the JSON body; pay and retry with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE, or send X-API-Key with prepaid balance.","headers":{"PAYMENT-REQUIRED":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"x402Version":{"type":"integer"},"accepts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"error":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}}},"/v1/leads/verify":{"post":{"summary":"Verify a sales lead: NL/BE register, VAT, mail server, IBAN, sanctions, lead score","description":"Lead verify for one NL or BE sales lead: is it a real, active company? Checks the KVK or KBO register (status, legal form, start date, main activity, staff, registered address) and cross-checks whatever else the lead holds: VAT number with VIES, mail server and disposable domain, IBAN country and bank (the account holder is not checked), and the company name against the OFAC, EU and UN sanctions lists. Returns a verdict, a 0-100 lead score, flags and one action per flag. An input not given is not checked and never counts against the lead.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"country":{"type":"string","description":"Register country: NL (KVK) or BE (KBO)"},"company_number":{"type":"string","description":"8-digit KVK number or 10-digit KBO/CBE number. company_number or name is required; BE needs company_number"},"name":{"type":"string","description":"Company name as the lead gave it"},"vat_number":{"type":"string","description":"EU VAT number, checked with VIES"},"email":{"type":"string","description":"Contact email; only its domain is checked"},"domain":{"type":"string","description":"Company website domain"},"address":{"type":"object","description":"Address the lead gave, compared with the registered address","properties":{"street":{"type":"string"},"house_number":{"type":"string"},"postcode":{"type":"string"},"city":{"type":"string"}}},"iban":{"type":"string","description":"IBAN the lead gave; validated locally, only the last 4 are returned"},"target_industries":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":100},"maxItems":20,"description":"Ideal-customer industries: SBI/NACE code prefixes (\"62\", \"64.20\") or plain words matched as whole words against the register's activity descriptions. Information only: never changes the score."},"target_size":{"type":"object","properties":{"min":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"max":{"type":"integer","minimum":0}},"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Ideal-customer employee range, both ends inclusive. Information only."}},"required":["country"]}}}},"security":[{"ApiKey":[]},{}],"x-payment-info":{"price":{"mode":"fixed","currency":"USD","amount":"0.27"},"protocols":[{"x402":{}}]},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Success","content":{"application/json":{"example":{"schema_version":"lead-verify-v1","verdict":"real_active","reason":null,"lead_score":95,"company":{"registered":true,"status":"active","legal_form":"Besloten vennootschap","registered_name":"Test BV Donald","name_match":1.0,"registered_since":"2017-05-19","age_years":9.4,"sbi_main":"01241","employees":1,"registered_address":{"street":"Hizzaarderlaan","house_number":"3 A","postcode":"8823 SJ","city":"Lollum","country":"NL"},"address_shielded":false,"address_match":1.0},"vat":{"checked":false,"valid":null,"name_match":null,"reason":null},"iban":{"checked":true,"valid":true,"country":"NL","bank":"ABN AMRO BANK N.V.","bic":"ABNANL2A","last4":"4300","country_agreement":true,"holder_checked":false},"sanctions":{"screened":true,"hit":false,"lists_as_of":{"OFAC SDN":"2026-10-01"},"reason":null},"email":{"checked":true,"has_mx":true,"disposable":false},"flags":[],"findings":[],"correlations":{"kvk_website_match":null,"phone_match":null,"website_identifier_match":null,"kbo_contact_match":null,"kbo_vat_address_match":null},"dormant_shell":{"score":0,"signals":[],"unknown":["no_website","no_annual_accounts"],"flag_at":50},"icp_fit":null,"website_phones":[],"website_phones_reason":"website_phones_disabled","discovered_identifiers":[],"identifier_discovery_reason":"number_given","sources_checked":4,"checked_at":"2026-10-02T10:00:00+00:00"}}}},"402":{"description":"Payment required. The x402 v2 challenge is in the base64 PAYMENT-REQUIRED header and the JSON body; pay and retry with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE, or send X-API-Key with prepaid balance.","headers":{"PAYMENT-REQUIRED":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"x402Version":{"type":"integer"},"accepts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"error":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}}},"/v1/mcp/check-entity":{"post":{"summary":"Verify an entity (MCP tool form of the entity check)","description":"MCP tool: entity trust check for LLM agents. Runs the /v1/entity/check engine on entity_name, country, kvk_number and domain only, so up to 5 sources (no IBAN, VAT 